# The full `<city>.discovery.json` evidence dumps are REGENERABLE in seconds and run to ~0.6–1.3 MB
# each, so they are not committed. What IS committed is the reviewable output:
#   • `<city>.discovery.md`  — the human triage table + draft evidence-register rows
#   • `cold-start.jsonl`     — the Probe C aggregation records
#
# Regenerate the full evidence with:
#   node discover.mjs --city cordoba --deep 30 --out reports
#   node discover.mjs --city murcia  --deep 30 --out reports
*.discovery.json
